## Testing Considerations

### Testable Code

```typescript
// ✓ Good: Pure function (easy to test)
export function sortNodes(nodes: LotusNode[]): LotusNode[] {
  return [...nodes].sort((a, b) => (a.order ?? 0) - (b.order ?? 0));
}

// ✗ Bad: Side effects (hard to test)
function sortNodes() {
  globalNodes.sort(...);  // Mutates global state
}
```

